{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"老挝","country_iso":"LAO","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:18:22.364257","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"LAO-HB-0008","ldc":"Yes","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"中老115千伏联网电力贸易项目","project_name_en":"China-Laos 115kV Interconnection Power Trade Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"南方电网云南国际CSGYNIC","content":"近日，南方电网云南国际公司与老挝国家电力公司在国家能源局和老挝国家能矿部共同召开的中国-老挝能源合作工作组第二次会议上，正式签署了115千伏中老联网项目购售电协议。\n作为中老双向电力贸易的试点，115千伏中老双向电力贸易购售电合同明确，中老双方将依托现有115千伏线路把老挝富余水电回送中国进行消纳，同时对老挝北部供电不足区域进行补充送电，由过去单向对老送电转变为双向送电，有效形成中老两国电力互补。据悉，现存的115千伏线路于2009年12月投运，已联网运行12年，对老挝北部送电10余亿电量，助力老挝北部经济社会发展。\n未来，双方将提升中老高电压等级电力互联互通水平和电力贸易规模，推动清洁能源跨区域优化配置，进一步落实“双碳”目标，为全球碳减排作出贡献。","content_sha256":"eb22944698f976e7319e4a60b11d966d869c2ee626ca709fa4a0265cd408b30b","id":16895,"publish_date":"2022-03-11 15:25:00","title":"南方电网云南国际：115千伏中老双向电力贸易购售电合同顺利签署","title_sha256":"0a47852398e6e1482f713cdc80e3de2b58763372597bff578b7f7babb850095e","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/26577.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"LAO-HB-0008","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:18:22.366531","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"LAO-HB-0008-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"http://www.sasac.gov.cn/n4470048/n26915116/n29064997/n29065009/c29065309/content.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"南方电网云南国际有限责任公司; 老挝国家电力公司","project_developer_en":"China Southern Power Grid Yunnan International Co.